  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp; is given as<math><mo>=</mo><mn>450</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp; is given as<math><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>We know that <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Raoult&rsquo;s law.</p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Raoult&rsquo;s law.</p><p>From Dalton&rsquo;s law <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></mfrac></math> = <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>750</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>450</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
